OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for 52 homes in village
OL,4,Araise 'grave concerns'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for dozens of new homes in a
OL,7,Fvillage have prompted "grave concerns"
OL,8,Ffrom a councillor.
OL,10,FShropshire councillors are due to
OL,11,Fconsider applications for developments
OL,12,Fof 42 and 10 homes in Whittington next
OL,13,FTuesday.
OL,15,FWhittington councillor David Walker and
OL,16,Flocal residents have raised concerns
OL,17,Fabout the impact on the character of
OL,18,Fthe village, road safety, flooding,
OL,19,Fsustainability and access to services.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
